WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.952 --> 00:00:10.920
At leading wedding-parent shops in Seoul, using a partial hairpiece typically adds around 50,000 to 100,000 won.

2
00:00:11.256 --> 00:00:18.144
This fairly covers the cost of the hairpiece material itself and the artist's specialized skill in blending it in naturally,

3
00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:22.608
which is what it takes to fully complete a style with short, thin hair.

4
00:00:22.944 --> 00:00:31.344
We always recommend using your own hair first, and only turn to a hairpiece when that's not possible — its cost comes on top of the base wedding-parent makeup price.

5
00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:40.992
A full wig, such as one for chemotherapy hair loss, needs to be custom-fitted to your head shape, so you'll either bring your own or pay a separate rental fee from a wig specialist.
